title: 'fix(parachains): Ensure broker parachain reachability in coretime benchmarks'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    fixes #8869

    This PR ensures the broker parachain is reachable before running benchmarks by calling `SendXcm::ensure_successful_delivery()` to set up the necessary XCM routing infrastructure.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: patch
